    (v_topic_id, 'ECG: Peaked T waves, widened QRS, "sine wave" appearance. Electrolyte?', '["HypoK", "Hyperkalemia", "HypoCa", "HyperCa"]', 1, 'Hyperkalemia progresses from peaked T waves to QRS widening and sine waves.'),
